== Effects ==
* Gives an {{E|Eternal Heart}} upon activation.

== Notes ==
* If used after clearing a [[floor]], before proceeding to the next one, it guarantees a new [[Heart Container]] every floor.
* Since it adds the eternal heart directly to the health bar instead of spawning it on the floor, the item is useless for {{C|Keeper|n}} and {{c|Tainted Keeper|n}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns white, heart-shaped wisps in the inner ring. Wisps' tears have 0.75 shot speed. The wisps' tears effectively act as though they have {{I|Sacred Heart}}.}}
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Grants one full Heart Container upon use.
* {{c|Tainted Eden}}: Health ups granted by eternal hearts are not rerolled when Tainted Eden takes damage.

== Interactions ==
* {{c|Tainted Magdalene}}: Doesn't benefit from her passive ability, giving only 1 Eternal Heart as usual.

